@startuml GymManagementUseCase
title Gym Membership Management System -- Use Case Diagram
left to right direction

actor "Staff (User)" as Staff

rectangle "Gym Membership Management System" {
    usecase "List plans"                    as UC1
    usecase "Build a new plan"              as UC2
    usecase "Enrol a member"                as UC3
    usecase "List members"                  as UC4
    usecase "Change member status"          as UC5
    usecase "Attach a notifier"             as UC6
    usecase "Publish payment-due (targeted)"     as UC7
    usecase "Publish renewal reminder (targeted)" as UC8
    usecase "Publish class cancellation (broadcast)" as UC9
    usecase "Publish promotion (broadcast)"      as UC10
    usecase "Show summary"                  as UC11
    usecase "Load demo scenario"            as UC12
}

Staff --> UC1
Staff --> UC2
Staff --> UC3
Staff --> UC4
Staff --> UC5
Staff --> UC6
Staff --> UC7
Staff --> UC8
Staff --> UC9
Staff --> UC10
Staff --> UC11
Staff --> UC12

note bottom of UC2 : Uses Builder --\nimmutable plan,\nvalidated in build().
note bottom of UC5 : Validated by\nMembershipStatus state machine.
note bottom of UC6 : Adds an Observer\nto the member.
note bottom of UC7 : Targeted event:\nonly that member's notifiers fire.
note bottom of UC9 : Broadcast event:\nevery attached notifier fires.

@enduml
